# Start zero-level calibration (SDO 0x2000). The sensor must be over bare
# floor, away from tape, markers and other magnetic sources, and stationary.
# Firmware (application/src/sensing.c, sensing_zero_sensor) saves the zero
# reference to non-volatile memory itself, so this persists across power
# cycles; see README.
---
bool ok                  # SDO download acknowledged by the sensor
